// C language package. Declarations here are visible at every output target
// that selects --lang c.
//
// The C a program is written in compiles as both C11 and C17, and calls
// nothing beyond the C library and the libraries its `c.link`s name. Its
// runtime is pkg/c, written beside the program: the arena a turn's
// strings are made in, and what C has no spelling for. `int` is `int64_t`,
// so it holds 64 bits as it does on Go and Kotlin, and signed arithmetic
// wraps as it does there: the program is compiled with `-fwrapv`.
